      "title": "Reference dataset ingestion",
      "description": "Ingest a published REFERENCE dataset — a constants table such as CODATA, AME or PDG — into a library entry whose values are addressable in prose as {{ <instance>.library.<entry>.<slug> }}, with edition, source, sha256 and licence recorded. Use when a paper quotes a physical constant, when a value is hard-coded in a script or registry, or before adding a \"vendored snapshot\" of someone else's numbers.",
